Bug: on loss, mapBtn hidden! We set `mapBtn.classList.toggle('hidden', !win)` → hidden on loss, and retryBtn hidden too, so only TRY AGAIN. We intended BACK TO MAP visible. Need to show map on loss. Change toggle: `mapBtn.classList.toggle('hidden', false)` always visible, or remove hidden. On win map visible; on loss also visible. So just `mapBtn.classList.remove('hidden')`. But for ending screen, map hidden separately. In showResultScreen, set map visible always. Let's fix.

Also retryBtn is hidden always now, redundant but okay.

Fix:
```
mainBtn.classList.remove('hidden');
retryBtn.classList.add('hidden');
mapBtn.classList.remove('hidden');
```
Then win branch sets texts. Simplify.

